name: ['Academy at Tolaria West', 'Agyrem', 'Bant', 'Cliffside Market', 'Eloren Wilds', 'Feeding Grounds', 'Fields of Summer', 'Glimmervoid Basin', 'Goldmeadow', 'Grixis', 'Immersturm', 'Isle of Vesuva', 'Izzet Steam Maze', 'Krosa', 'Lethe Lake', 'Llanowar', 'Minamo', 'Murasa', 'Naar Isle', 'Naya', 'Otaria', 'Panopticon', 'Pools of Becoming', "Raven's Run", 'Sanctum of Serra', 'Sea of Sand', 'Shiv', 'Skybreen', 'Sokenzan', 'Stronghold Furnace', 'The Aether Flues', 'The Dark Barony', 'The Eon Fog', 'The Fourth Sphere', 'The Great Forest', 'The Hippodrome', 'The Maelstrom', 'Turri Island', 'Undercity Reaches', 'Velis Vel']
